@startuml getRemoteProtocolAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getRemoteProtocolAsync – Retrieve TCP Client Remote Protocol
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "TCP Client Interface" as tcr #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  - tcpClientUuid
end note

requestor -> tcr: (tcpClientUuid)
activate tcr

tcr -> jd: read logical-termination-points
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> tcr: TCP client interface list
deactivate jd

note over tcr
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Locate TCP client LTP by tcpClientUuid  
  - Read attribute:
      * tcp-client-interface-configuration/remote-protocol  
  - Convert ONF protocol enum to readable key:
      * HTTP  
      * HTTPS  
      * NOT_YET_DEFINED  
  - Return protocol key  
  - Return undefined if not configured or UUID not found
end note

tcr --> requestor: protocolKey | undefined
deactivate tcr

@enduml
